{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status Notice</strong><br>This game is currently in active development.<br>The available build is not representative of the final product, and several core systems, features, and content elements are still being improved or may change significantly before release. Players may encounter bugs, incomplete features, placeholder assets, and ongoing balancing work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We continually update the game based on internal testing and community feedback. The current build should be considered work-in-progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding action of &quot;Shadows of Soldiers,&quot; an adrenaline-fuelled 8v8 third-person cover-based tactical multiplayer shooter! Prepare to embark on an epic battlefield adventure, where strategic choices and teamwork determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3f9e5afade9a3b4f80ad2c46bd6fa79c.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span> Select your role from three distinct classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juggernaut</strong> - Unleash raw power on the battlefield as the mighty Juggernaut. Armed with<br> devastating weaponry and  fortified armor, you're a force to be reckoned with. Crush <br> your enemies and lead your team to glory.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow</strong> - Become the master of stealth and precision. As a Shadow, you can slip into the<br> darkness, surprising foes with deadly efficiency. Employ your cunning and agility to <br> outmaneuver enemies and strike from unexpected angles.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander</strong> - Lead your squad to triumph with tactical brilliance and keen strategic insights. <br>The Commander class empowers you with the ability to coordinate your team,<br> call  in powerful support, and seize the battlefield's critical points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers a choice of two unique abilities, allowing you to tailor your play style to perfection.<br> Strategically select one ability to equip and deploy in intense battles to turn the tide in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/139bed5eabaa890320dc23a9e091e22c.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest/Team Death Match   <br>Join the battle in different game modes, each with unique maps with their lore behind it. There are currently 5 unique maps for conquest and 3 for TDM to explore. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/82f2d0da732f5cddd0e219b1ce85614d.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed<br> cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch<br> calculated counterattacks.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/484c1d740a3bf547416b2e4d26853b48.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong> <br>Customization knows no bounds in &quot;Shadows of Soldiers.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization</strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1770076347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras_big/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.webp?t=1770076347 width=1560 height=839 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1770076347\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1770076347\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1401200?t=1770076347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1401200?t=1770076347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/a855f60f39e9834d73dba71fc91c82d3eed90a30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770076347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/a855f60f39e9834d73dba71fc91c82d3eed90a30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770076347","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Mature Content Notice\r\nShadows of Soldiers contains scenes of realistic violence, combat, and weapon-based combat. Players may encounter blood, injury effects, and death.\r\nThere is no explicit sexual content or nudity. The game does not depict sexual acts, drug use, or self-harm.\r\nThe core themes involve military conflict and warfare; some scenes may be intense or disturbing for younger or sensitive players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status Notice</strong><br>This game is currently in active development.<br>The available build is not representative of the final product, and several core systems, features, and content elements are still being improved or may change significantly before release. Players may encounter bugs, incomplete features, placeholder assets, and ongoing balancing work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We continually update the game based on internal testing and community feedback. The current build should be considered work-in-progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding action of &quot;Shadows of Soldiers,&quot; an adrenaline-fuelled 8v8 third-person cover-based tactical multiplayer shooter! Prepare to embark on an epic battlefield adventure, where strategic choices and teamwork determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3f9e5afade9a3b4f80ad2c46bd6fa79c.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span> Select your role from three distinct classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juggernaut</strong> - Unleash raw power on the battlefield as the mighty Juggernaut. Armed with<br> devastating weaponry and  fortified armor, you're a force to be reckoned with. Crush <br> your enemies and lead your team to glory.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/d42d73a1b4be0803d55a71cfb02c9188.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ca797cb5bf50db88237935840c6f6570.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow</strong> - Become the master of stealth and precision. As a Shadow, you can slip into the<br> darkness, surprising foes with deadly efficiency. Employ your cunning and agility to <br> outmaneuver enemies and strike from unexpected angles.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/be5243626dd015af9c8763bbb6dd8060.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/3d25733d7fbc87cebd9e652f7f9dc909.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander</strong> - Lead your squad to triumph with tactical brilliance and keen strategic insights. <br>The Commander class empowers you with the ability to coordinate your team,<br> call  in powerful support, and seize the battlefield's critical points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/2b2c72a922257135734d4774a4a7b502.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=400 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/5bb95fd975f1e08c7e100e1522e75ee7.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers a choice of two unique abilities, allowing you to tailor your play style to perfection.<br> Strategically select one ability to equip and deploy in intense battles to turn the tide in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/139bed5eabaa890320dc23a9e091e22c.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest/Team Death Match   <br>Join the battle in different game modes, each with unique maps with their lore behind it. There are currently 5 unique maps for conquest and 3 for TDM to explore. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/82f2d0da732f5cddd0e219b1ce85614d.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's environment becomes your greatest ally. Utilize the intricately designed<br> cover system to shield yourself from incoming fire, survey the battlefield, and launch<br> calculated counterattacks.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=478 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/230ad2e70118d8a3103428f9d219e9ce.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/484c1d740a3bf547416b2e4d26853b48.avif?t=1770076347\" width=1536 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong> <br>Customization knows no bounds in &quot;Shadows of Soldiers.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.poster.avif?t=1770076347\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.webm?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/19a0dcfa0e7c02ecd10b8b28b5a7a6b8.mp4?t=1770076347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance</strong> <strong>Customization</strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character with a plethora of armor, headgear, and outfits, making your warrior a true reflection of your style and personality.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.avif?t=1770076347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras_big/ec27a4ced2a96e8c16aec413d521b51a.webp?t=1770076347 width=1560 height=839 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/c8c134644236210b45c33fc6b8adfbd0.avif?t=1770076347\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use Discord as our primary communication platform. Join to follow our progress, Be first to know our updates or find other like minded players to team up with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/extras/13053461652dc79122c24c332f3f8d90.avif?t=1770076347\" width=610 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our YouTube to see the latest developments or watch our streams where the team have discussions and play the game!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ghost in the Wire"],"ext_user_account_notice":"SoS Account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401200/f406381fee04c6a7ea941d75622ce94ee5d38830/header.jpg?t=1770076347","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1401200/2113376020/e0a8c0dd36605aca1dfd974cb1b4c1bef3de88ef/1769684373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769778436","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1401200/2113376020/e0a8c0dd36605aca1dfd974cb1b4c1bef3de88ef/1769684373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769778436","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1401200/2113376020/e0a8c0dd36605aca1dfd974cb1b4c1bef3de88ef/1769684373/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769778436","id":257218782,"name":"Shadows of Soldiers official release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati